{"title":"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be82bae1c6366f386ccad61bfaefb45a87021066.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{n^3+3}{n^2+7}\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" />\nis a positive integer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Perform polynomial long division to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/73258c0bae7b342895a4dda5ebfb177cc9265b75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^3 + 3}{n^2 + 7} = n + \\frac{3-7n}{n^2 + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"164\" height=\"40\" />.  Note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/6/f06143693d1a7e9abfadd13f8360b595daae3617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 + 7 &gt; |3-7n|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/4/46432deec330eaebcde11fcae80a8c97603991c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3-7n}{n^2 + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"53\" height=\"39\" /> can not be an integer.  Thus, all of the solutions satisfy the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fa82ec8c78825af8c8ee27785236074adc08d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-7n| \\ge n^2 + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434da9c5ce436bf96d16a46b919a534590853492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-7n \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18a5d225b2585cf83649f57abff4c8ec43c6972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le \\frac73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.  However, there are no positive integers in this case.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/348deabbe663f9de368049b095feb399f9fd8679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-7n &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/2/ab285b9c0ddbc5e26aaac78a15abfad6fec6a197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; \\frac37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/4953ea1c480469e90c1cd370fb9bdf4fe50a750e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7n-3 \\ge n^2 + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"17\" />.  Rearranging the second inequality results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/6055591bc01cf7c635ff1914cc4a8c301d26f58d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\ge n^2 - 7n + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"17\" />.  Factoring results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e45ea41d979e431595fd2500a945628051bcf46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\ge (n-5)(n-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5a1591386b33e9608caf60874a92c001143b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\le n \\le 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow there are only four possible positive integers, so we can use trial and error to determine if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967f2b8ad036d45271f23e85e87f43785a2485a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^3 + 3}{n^2 + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"52\" height=\"40\" /> is a positive integer.  After doing trial and error, the only positive integers that make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967f2b8ad036d45271f23e85e87f43785a2485a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^3 + 3}{n^2 + 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"52\" height=\"40\" /> an integer are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f77d3e14c9a1201eb017cc9ef82548d2facfd79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n = 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b87619d0b1ed27e4c0f69286cfb2ae49dc2f6920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO\">2001 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016225225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 122/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 923/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 51/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3363/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.373      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%   10.373      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17913:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016225225 and revision id 112855. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}